  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.297,
  "total_seconds": 55.73,
  "master": "H:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-062-greene\\06_voice\\draft\\short260\\en_us\\short260_vc_draft_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "An officer made one attempt at personal service. If nobody answered, the paper went on the apartment door immediately, and the legal clock began.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.988,
      "seconds": 7.988,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:45e19009fdcf7d48f1f43da9baf8389d9b0387de405085a0d77309a4007ecba6"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The officer did not have to return in the evening, on another day, or when the tenant was more likely to be home.",
      "start": 8.208,
      "end": 14.106,
      "seconds": 5.898,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:5617fa83f76ec412051ebe3f856369b0f60e88a7d99f592dc5a1a19c78e7baaf"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The statute and the servers' practice made no provision for even a second attempt at handing the notice to someone.",
      "start": 14.326,
      "end": 20.131,
      "seconds": 5.805,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6ddb9a02064a8c864c0d2ada98019ff40b64ad5142b00193968b9d444d506c6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The opinion said nobody was home in a good percentage of cases, though it gave no time of day for those visits.",
      "start": 20.351,
      "end": 26.388,
      "seconds": 6.037,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6649add6c792b20bb9222a11708cc86e744d4d77eb48d134137322195cf69ea8"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Posting was not automatically unconstitutional. The Court said it can often be an appropriate and effective substitute when personal service is inconvenient.",
      "start": 26.608,
      "end": 35.292,
      "seconds": 8.684,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:13dec2d79fb7b27df1354360007109989fa11b9b48cd4f3f9c13c8f534ac98ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "But missing someone once hardly shows that a tenant abandoned an apartment or stopped caring about the proceeding.",
      "start": 35.512,
      "end": 41.41,
      "seconds": 5.898,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:011fced062477c22586f67dabfb6a8d13f2eefc90b22ca0eb396a752535be8a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "That is why a paper placed on the door after one failed visit was only formal notice, not reliable notice here.",
      "start": 41.63,
      "end": 48.596,
      "seconds": 6.966,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:774281403cd44c3d9107d4e2aca8fef59aeaf300e40a1b09192795cfaed5a441"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "The constitutional problem was not the knock itself. It was treating that single unanswered knock as the end of the search.",
      "start": 48.816,
      "end": 55.736,
      "seconds": 6.92,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:15fd48a4355e7892aaae9e3d47cd2f42f0e439703f12b956235bb5936f19f5c9"
    }
  ]
}
